[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025911\">7055B42</a> (right\nside).</p><p>1. Undo the nut.</p><p>2. Move the horn unit and bracket slightly.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections for the horns (1a, 1b,\n1c, 1d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Low-tone horn</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024584\">P11A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Low-tone horn</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024586\">P11B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3c</p></td><td><p>High-tone horn</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024580\">P10A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3d</p></td><td><p>High-tone horn</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024582\">P10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Recover the horn unit and bracket.</p><p>5. Undo the bolt fixing the horn.</p><p>6. Remove the horn.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005027.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the horn is not\ndamaged and test its operation.</p><p>Refit the horn fixing it using the nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Position the horn unit and bracket and\nsecure it using the nut.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025911\">7055B42</a> (Right side)</p>"]]